  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Additive release with the host-owned security execution-context provider contract. GraphQL secure query execution is provided by Foundgine.GraphQL.HotChocolate.Execution. The Supply Chain reference sample is source-integrated against this release line. 1.0.0: Semver stability declaration only; no runtime capability change since 0.5.0. 0.5.0: Packaging/documentation cleanup only; no abstraction-contract runtime capability change. 0.3.0: Provider-independent contracts and identifiers formed the foundation of the validated semantic execution surface.",
